@startuml
title SD-UI06 — Event payment and inspection
caption To-Be draft | F06 · Frontend · Customer /events/:id · merchant /merchant/events/:id
actor User
boundary "Route and InstalmentTimeline, EquipmentChecklist and ExtrasForm" as UI
participant "Shared API client" as Client
participant "Authorized API" as API
User -> UI : Open view or submit action
UI -> Client : event actions, proof and receipts
Client -> API : Fetch or submit with applicable guards
alt Success
 API --> Client : Current typed result
 Client --> UI : Render or refresh authoritative data
 opt Timely balance proof awaiting review
  UI --> User : Show slot reserved and disable overdue cancellation
 end
else grace, incorrect proof or invalid inspection
 API --> Client : Typed failure
 Client --> UI : Show the guarded next action and safe error
end
@enduml
